<div class="imageText__mainWrapper">
  <div class="page-width ImageWithtext__container">
    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap:40px; align-items:center;">
      <div class="image-with-text__media-item">
        <img src="//naturaltein.in/cdn/shop/files/prestigious-farmer.webp?v=1749184539&width=1200" alt="Naturaltein Prestigious Certifications" style="width:100%; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="check-img-content">
        <h2>NATURALTEIN has the prestigious certifications - which means that:</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Our protein production processes are clean, sustainable and not harmful to nature or any animals.</li>
          <li>Our products undergo stringent compliance checks by the EU Control Bodies / Authorities for Organic, Health and Consumer Protection rules.</li>
          <li>The cows whose milk is used for our protein production graze on open farmlands & their health & welfare are well-looked after.</li>
          <li>Our products are completely GMO-free.</li>
          <li>We observe strict vigilance regarding the use of chemicals, artificial enhancers, and antibiotics.</li>
          <li>We observe stringent restrictions on the use of artificial food additives or chemical processing aids.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="image_imagetext" style="margin-top:20px;">
          <img src="//naturaltein.in/cdn/shop/files/brand_authorized.webp?quality=80&v=1749184551&width=1200" alt="Brand Authorizations and Seals" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

